    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970418.0186\n\nBANGKOK, April 18 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nThai share prices down 0.2 percent\n\n\n\n\nThai share prices fell 0.2 percent Friday as investors factored in expectations of poor earnings in first quarter company reports due out next week, brokers said.\n\nThe broad-based Stock Exchange of Thailand (SET) index dropped 1.53 points to finish at 700.23 points, while the selected SET-50 index was off 0.19 points at 53.29 points.",
